    "The first baseline has no memory.stat counters, so the historical charge difference cannot be assigned exactly.",
    "PSS excludes unmapped file cache and kernel memory and depends on sharing with other processes.",
    "Capacity and timing vary; three runs do not establish confidence intervals.",
    "Current-image results do not prove an application memory improvement."
